{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme is based on the Wireframe theme (which is dedicated to mockups and prototypes)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is possible to override the semantic tokens of colors, change the default border radius and choose the font family to apply."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme, as a child of Wireframe theme does not embed by default charts colors nor decorative colors yet, but they can be defined."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"level":2,"anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme","text":"How to use the theme","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" directly. To use the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" for your root view and give it an instance of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". Keep in mind the themes are "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift class objects"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and can be heavy, so you may use only as instance as singleton and not store any properties."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            OUDSThemeableView(theme: WhiteLabelTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then, in your views, you can simply use the theme through an environment variable to get the tokens:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct SomeView: View {","","    \/\/ Get OUDS environment variable for theme thanks to themeable view","    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme","    ","    var body: some View {","        ","        \/\/ Use the theme to retrieve the tokens","        \/\/ For spaces: theme.spaces","        \/\/ For sizes: theme.sizes","        \/\/ For borders: theme.borders","        \/\/ For elevations: theme.elevations","        \/\/ For opacities: theme.opacities","        \/\/ For colors: theme.colors","        \/\/ For button configuration: theme.button","        \/\/ For link configuration: theme.link","        \/\/ Etc.","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Typography","text":"Typography","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme uses the native system font family by default, but it can be defined otherwise."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will need to add to define the font family parameter of the theme."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Font family name fo which resources should be loaded and used then","let fontFamily = \"Winky Rough\" ","","let theme = WhiteLabelTheme(fontFamily: fontFamily)    "],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"And register the fonts resources only one time:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["static var fontsAlreadyRegistered = false","","private func registerFonts() {","    if !Self.fontsAlreadyRegistered {","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Light\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.light))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.regular))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Medium\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.medium))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_SemiBold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.semibold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Bold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.bold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Black\", forCombination: PSFNMK(fontFamily, Font.Weight.black))","        ","        let fonts = yourAppBundle.urls(forResourcesWithExtension: \"ttf\", subdirectory: nil)","        fonts?.forEach {","            CTFontManagerRegisterFontsForURL($0 as CFURL, .process, nil)","        }","        Self.fontsAlreadyRegistered = true","    }    ","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The helper "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registerFont(postScript:forCombination:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is an OUDS helper which will define the relationship between the font fmaily you use with a weight in one side, and the PostScript identifier of the font defined in the TTF in the other side."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"How-to-enrich-the-theme","text":"How to enrich the theme","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Today for White Label theme only the colors, the font family and the tunning can be changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"By default nor the Wireframe theme nor the White Label theme have colors decorative and color charts tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you want to define them you will have to define your own tokens providers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The White Label theme uses the other tokens of colors of Wireframe theme; you can subclass it for your needs in you want."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class MyColorTokensProvider: WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider {","","    \/\/ Give the values you want to the tokens you want","    \/\/ Some tokens have only one value...","    @objc override var repositoryInfoLow: ColorSemanticToken { ColorRawTokens.functionalSun200 }","    @objc override var repositoryInfoHighest: ColorSemanticToken { ColorRawTokens.functionalSun800 }","    ","    \/\/ ...and other tokens can have a pair of values, for light and dark modes","    @objc override var surfaceBrandPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken { MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: repositoryInfoLow, dark: repositoryInfoHighest) }","}    "],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"How-it-looks-like","text":"How it looks like","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To test your own White Label theme implementation, you can use for example the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add you own implementation for the tokens of "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox\/blob\/develop\/DesignToolbox\/DesignToolbox\/White%20Label%20Example\/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then build and run the app and enjoy!"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["","\/\/ MARK: - Borders","","class DesignToolboxBorderSemanticTokensProvider: WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider {","    ","    override open var radiusDefault: BorderRadiusSemanticToken { BorderRawTokens.radius300 }","}","","let kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelBorders = DesignToolboxBorderSemanticTokensProvider()","    ","\/\/ MARK: - Fonts","","let kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily = \"Winky Rough\"","","\/\/ To prevent to register each time the fonts and get warnings","var designToolboxWhiteLabelFontAlreadyRegistered = false","","func registerDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFonts() {","    if !designToolboxWhiteLabelFontAlreadyRegistered {","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Light\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.light))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.regular))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Medium\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.medium))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_SemiBold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.semibold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Bold\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.bold))","        registerFont(postScript: \"WinkyRough-Regular_Black\", forCombination: PSFNMK(kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily, Font.Weight.black))","        ","        let fonts = Bundle.main.urls(forResourcesWithExtension: \"ttf\", subdirectory: nil)","        fonts?.forEach {","            CTFontManagerRegisterFontsForURL($0 as CFURL, .process, nil)","        }","        ","        designToolboxWhiteLabelFontAlreadyRegistered = true","    }","}","","\/\/ MARK: - Colors (raw)","","enum DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors {","","    static let bloodRed = \"#C0392BFF\"","    static let vividRed = \"#FF6B6BFF\"","    static let concreteGrey = \"#F0F0F0FF\"","    static let nearBlack = \"#1C1C1EFF\"","    static let softGrey = \"#E0E0E0FF\"","    static let deepGrey = \"#2C2C2EFF\"","    static let mutedLight = \"#6E6E73FF\"","    static let mutedDark = \"#8E8E93FF\"","    static let borderLight = \"#D0D0D0FF\"","}","","\/\/ MARK: - Colors (semantic)","","\/\/ Override the tokens you want","class DesignToolboxColorSemanticTokensProvider: WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider {","","       override open var bgPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.concreteGrey, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.nearBlack)","       }","","       override open var bgSecondary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.softGrey, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.deepGrey)","       }","","       override open var contentDefault: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.nearBlack, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.concreteGrey)","       }","","       override open var contentMuted: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.mutedLight, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.mutedDark)","       }","","       override open var contentBrandPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.bloodRed, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.vividRed)","       }","","       override open var actionEnabled: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.bloodRed, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.vividRed)","       }","","       override open var borderBrandPrimary: MultipleColorSemanticToken {","           MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.bloodRed, dark: DesignToolboxWhiteLabelRawColors.vividRed)","       }","}","","let kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelColors = DesignToolboxColorSemanticTokensProvider()","","\/\/ MARK: - Theme instanciation","","let myDesignToolboxWhiteLabelTheme = WhiteLabelTheme(borders: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelBorders,","                                                     colors: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelColors,","                                                     name: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelName,","                                                     fontFamily: kDesignToolboxWhiteLabelFontFamily)","","\/\/ MARK: - Inject the theme","","var body: some View {","    OUDSThemeableView(theme: myDesignToolboxWhiteLabelTheme) {","        YourAppContent()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"This White Label theme is a specific theme. It has been designed to let users have their own theme to update like a grey label theme, or to keep as is like a white label theme.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Group","anchor":"Group","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme"]},{"title":"Classes","anchor":"Classes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"],"generated":true},{"title":"Extended Modules","anchor":"Extended-Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/SwiftUICore"],"generated":true}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Library","symbolKind":"module","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"Theme White Label"}],"modules":[{"name":"Theme White Label"}],"role":"collection","externalID":"OUDSThemesWhiteLabel","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_whitelabel.png","type":"icon"}],"title":"Theme White Label"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox/blob/develop/DesignToolbox/DesignToolbox/White%20Label%20Example/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift":{"type":"link","title":"White Label Theme Example","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox\/blob\/develop\/DesignToolbox\/DesignToolbox\/White%20Label%20Example\/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"White Label Theme Example","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox\/blob\/develop\/DesignToolbox\/DesignToolbox\/White%20Label%20Example\/White%20Label%20Theme%20Example.swift"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox":{"type":"link","title":"Design System Toolbox application","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Design System Toolbox application","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios-design-system-toolbox"},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"color semantic tokens","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"multiple","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or not, and expose them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"}],"type":"topic","title":"WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/whitelabelthemecolorsemantictokensprovider","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel":{"title":"Theme White Label","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme White Label","kind":"text"}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_whitelabel.png"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"This White Label theme is a specific theme. It has been designed to let users have their own theme to update like a grey label theme, or to keep as is like a white label theme.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel","role":"collection"},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/WhiteLabelTheme":{"title":"WhiteLabelTheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelTheme","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelTheme"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/whitelabeltheme","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WhiteLabelTheme"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This White Label theme is a specific theme. It has been designed to let users have their own theme to update like a grey label theme, or to keep as is like a white label theme."}]},"ic_theme_whitelabel.png":{"type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/ic_theme_whitelabel.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"ic_theme_whitelabel.png","alt":null},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/SwiftUICore":{"title":"SwiftUICore","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/SwiftUICore","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/swiftuicore","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[]},"doc://OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/documentation/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel/WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider":{"title":"WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A class which wraps all ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"border semantic tokens"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" and expose them.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This provider should be integrated as a ","type":"text"},{"code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation inside ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so as to provide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all tokens to the users.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWhiteLabel\/WhiteLabelThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemeswhitelabel\/whitelabelthemebordersemantictokensprovider","role":"symbol"}}}